WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.226
Forklifts and pedestrians need clear separation.

2
00:00:03.226 --> 00:00:05.713
Use marked walkways and crossing points.

3
00:00:05.713 --> 00:00:09.709
Make eye contact with the operator where your procedure requires it.

4
00:00:09.709 --> 00:00:12.767
Never enter a blind spot or walk under a raised load.

5
00:00:12.767 --> 00:00:17.515
Operators must follow speed limits, sound warnings where required, and stop when

6
00:00:17.515 --> 00:00:19.493
the route is not clear.

7
00:00:19.493 --> 00:00:23.077
Pause and think: Where is the nearest blind corner on your route?
